      "label": "Black man with weary expression",
      "description": "A Black man with a bald head and a tired, exasperated facial expression, wearing a light blue button-up shirt with a microphone clipped to it. He appears to be in a formal or semi-formal setting, possibly a panel or interview, with a blue pixelated background. His expression is central to the meme's intent, conveying exhaustion or resignation.",
