      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "tired_boss_scene",
      "label": "man_expressing_resignation",
      "description": "A Black man with a weary expression is the central figure in the scene, positioned in the foreground. He is wearing a light blue button-up shirt with a microphone clipped to it, suggesting a formal or semi-formal setting like a panel or interview. The background is a blue pixelated screen, indicating a stage or studio environment. The scene is framed by overlaid text that conveys his emotional state and the meme's message. The man's expression and posture convey exhaustion and resignation, which is the core of the scene's interpretation.",
