      "instance_name": "snowflakes",
      "label": "snowflakes",
      "description": "A pejorative term used in online discourse to describe people perceived as overly sensitive, easily offended, or excessively cautious about social norms, often used to dismiss or mock their concerns. The term is not visible in the image but is central to the meme's text and intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
